{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "Vega · 期刊收录标签",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "short_description": "在知网、Web of Science 等学术平台直接显示 CSSCI / CSCD / 北核 / 中科院分区收录标签。",
  "description": "在知网、Web of Science、Google 学术等学术检索平台，直接在检索结果中的刊名旁显示期刊的收录标签：CSSCI 来源版/扩展版、CSCD 核心库/扩展库、北大核心、中科院大类分区 1-4 区（含 Top 与小类分区），并提示中科院《国际期刊预警名单》。\n\n【校内认定】另可选显示山西财经大学校内级别（A1/A2/A3/A4/B1 五档），依据山财校〔2023〕80 号《山西财经大学科研成果管理办法》，覆盖 2261 本。该口径因校而异，仅供该校师生参考，不代表普适的期刊分级。内置数据中 A3 及以下为推定档，可能与你掌握的实际情况有出入——点击标签即可自行升一级、降一级或直接选档，改动会被记住，也可一键还原。最终认定以学校科研管理部门审核为准。\n\n所有标签来源均可在扩展面板中单独开关（校内级别为一个总开关，档位在页面上调），改动即时生效。\n\n【数据版本】CSSCI 2025-2026、CSCD 2025-2026、北大核心期刊要目总览、中科院分区 2025 年版（终版）、山财校〔2023〕80 号五级目录。\n\n【隐私】全部数据内置于插件内，运行时不发起任何网络请求，不收集、不上传任何浏览记录或检索内容，断网亦可正常使用。\n\n支持山西财经大学 WebVPN 代理的知网页面。工具栏直接打开完整圆角浮层；浏览器内部页面打开独立设置页。",
  "icons": {
    "16": "icon16.png",
    "32": "icon32.png",
    "48": "icon48.png",
    "128": "icon128.png"
  },
  "permissions": [
    "storage",
    "activeTab",
    "scripting"
  ],
  "host_permissions": [
    "https://kns.cnki.net/*",
    "https://www.cnki.net/*",
    "https://*.webofscience.com/*",
    "https://*.clarivate.com/*",
    "https://scholar.google.com/*",
    "https://scholar.google.com.hk/*",
    "https://scholar.google.co.jp/*",
    "https://scholar.google.co.uk/*",
    "https://xueshu.baidu.com/*",
    "https://www.sciencedirect.com/*",
    "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/*",
    "https://link.springer.com/*",
    "https://www.semanticscholar.org/*",
    "https://webvpn.sxufe.edu.cn/*"
  ],
  "background": {
    "service_worker": "background.js"
  },
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://kns.cnki.net/*",
        "https://www.cnki.net/*",
        "https://*.webofscience.com/*",
        "https://*.clarivate.com/*",
        "https://scholar.google.com/*",
        "https://scholar.google.com.hk/*",
        "https://scholar.google.co.jp/*",
        "https://scholar.google.co.uk/*",
        "https://xueshu.baidu.com/*",
        "https://www.sciencedirect.com/*",
        "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/*",
        "https://link.springer.com/*",
        "https://www.semanticscholar.org/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "core/judge.js",
        "core/themes.js",
        "sites/index.js",
        "content.js",
        "settings-panel.js"
      ],
      "css": [
        "style.css"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_idle",
      "all_frames": false
    },
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://webvpn.sxufe.edu.cn/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "core/judge.js",
        "core/themes.js",
        "sites/index.js",
        "content.js",
        "settings-panel.js"
      ],
      "css": [
        "style.css"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_idle",
      "all_frames": true
    }
  ],
  "action": {
    "default_title": "Vega · 期刊收录标签"
  },
  "web_accessible_resources": [
    {
      "resources": [
        "style.css",
        "data/journals.json",
        "data/cas_detail.json",
        "selftest.html",
        "selftest.js",
        "core/judge.js",
        "sites/index.js"
      ],
      "matches": [
        "https://kns.cnki.net/*",
        "https://www.cnki.net/*",
        "https://*.webofscience.com/*",
        "https://*.clarivate.com/*",
        "https://scholar.google.com/*",
        "https://scholar.google.com.hk/*",
        "https://scholar.google.co.jp/*",
        "https://scholar.google.co.uk/*",
        "https://xueshu.baidu.com/*",
        "https://www.sciencedirect.com/*",
        "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/*",
        "https://link.springer.com/*",
        "https://www.semanticscholar.org/*",
        "https://webvpn.sxufe.edu.cn/*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "resources": [
        "popup/popup.html",
        "popup/boot.js",
        "popup/popup.js",
        "popup/panel.js",
        "icon32.png",
        "core/themes.js"
      ],
      "matches": [
        "http://*/*",
        "https://*/*"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
